# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  OPTIONAL: Rust (Cargo build output, rustfmt backups, compiler dumps)
#  Activate: remove the leading '# ' from every line below this banner.
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# # Cargo builds into target/ at the workspace root. Anchored so it cannot
# # interfere with other languages' rules; when the Java section is also
# # active, its unanchored target/ covers nested crates too.
# /target/
# **/*.rs.bk
# *.pdb
# # rustc internal-compiler-error dumps, written to the working directory.
# rustc-ice-*.txt

# # Cargo.lock should be COMMITTED — even for libraries (Cargo team
# # guidance since 2023).
